    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038700/extras/c7b8b72b2677d2bec3557a9e7c1962bc.avif?t=1718217614\" width=550 height=436 /></span><br>Duel waves of enemy fighters, giant robots, hulking battleships, and alien kaiju monsters in this arcade-style anime-mecha battler. Enter the satirical world of the year 80XX and play as one three pilots.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038700/extras/5f66d5c7a62dc8fe938d2aacbc88f708.avif?t=1718217614\" width=550 height=207 /></span><br><br><strong>Kit Kanzaki</strong>: Fiery-but-perpetually-broke ace freelance pilot of the Rabbit, a transforming jet/robot.<br><br><strong>Zakott La Salle</strong>: Handsome and intellectual Imperial tank commander with his armored wall-crawling Spider.<br><br><strong>Eden Endymion</strong>: Space pirate, heart-breaker, and speed demon pilot of the high-agility Falcon.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038700/extras/c7b8b72b2677d2bec3557a9e7c1962bc.avif?t=1718217614\" width=550 height=436 /></span><br>Duel waves of enemy fighters, giant robots, hulking battleships, and alien kaiju monsters in this arcade-style anime-mecha battler. Enter the satirical world of the year 80XX and play as one three pilots.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038700/extras/5f66d5c7a62dc8fe938d2aacbc88f708.avif?t=1718217614\" width=550 height=207 /></span><br><br><strong>Kit Kanzaki</strong>: Fiery-but-perpetually-broke ace freelance pilot of the Rabbit, a transforming jet/robot.<br><br><strong>Zakott La Salle</strong>: Handsome and intellectual Imperial tank commander with his armored wall-crawling Spider.<br><br><strong>Eden Endymion</strong>: Space pirate, heart-breaker, and speed demon pilot of the high-agility Falcon.",
